将要注入当前进程的环境变量（真值不落盘、不进命令行；口令 masked）：
  IT_GUARD_ENABLED             = true
  IT_GUARD_INSTANCEPORTS       = 3307
  IT_GUARD_RUNID               = dev12fix_20260914_1945
  IT_GUARD_SERVERFINGERPRINT   = <运行期由门禁6探针确定：@@hostname:@@port>
